# Placeholder / example URLs used in documentation code samples (not real endpoints).
# One regex per line, matched against each URL lychee finds.
your-app\.com
your-relayer-proxy\.com
localhost
127\.0\.0\.1
# Placeholder API key in infura sample URLs (sepolia/mainnet.infura.io/v3/YOUR_KEY) —
# matches the key, not the host, so real infura links would still be checked.
YOUR_KEY

# Daemon links that resolve only once released (SDK-375).
# Remove the next two after the first beta release that ships the daemon:
pkg\.go\.dev/github\.com/zama-ai/sdk/clients/go
docs\.zama\.org/protocol/sdk/(beta/)?native/
# Remove after the first stable release that ships the daemon:
raw\.githubusercontent\.com/zama-ai/sdk/[^/]+/packages/sdk-daemon/deploy/
